36	122	\N	2023-12-16 12:34:06.77	65.67	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/39/SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "17-05-2024 11:50:45", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>Engeneering innovations are becoming recently a huge aspect. Trying to solve problems, engineers are proposing a lots a applications that surprise us every day. Especially with the recent advances in artificial intellegnce (AI), the applications seems not to have a limit. Some people are fully pro AI, insisting in the adantages of the differents aspect of applications. But, other are just scared, because not limits seems to be in the horizon.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>AI applications is incressigly advancing nowadays. Many people are seriously alarming the humans about the ethic aspect. For example, Elon Mask, the SEO of Tesla, just announced that he will stop the reearch on AI. In china, humans are identified and recognized by cameras on streets and are attributed a social bonus if they help a old women in the street for example. And they are attributed a social malus is the throw a cigarette in the ground. Depending on his social score, a student can be prevented to reach a important univerity.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>In the other hand, some engineers are not seeing any problem. With AI, our mobiles are better helping us to find our ways. Doctocs are better detecting cancer cells. Blend people are driving cars with better AI assitance. Companies are save time and money. It is simply an economic pioneering way.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>It's true that with AI, engineers are solving many problems and offering many applications that can make our life easier. But these points does not justifiy using it in all domains, especially when there are some ethics issues. For example, considering people are just numbers and letting robots attribute scrore penalties for them, highlites an serious ethics issue. How can we predict a creminal person just based on its behaviour? In some reflexions, some ingeneers annouced that they can predict with AI solution, if a person will a be a killer. How can we judge a person on a crime before he do it.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Using engeneering advances and especially AI, is still an issue. For some people, AI applications are helping humanity solving many problems in differents aspects. For others, we should be careful when using AI, paying attention to ethic limitations. For some researchers, peoples should try to define the reglementations that would organize the research fields and applications of AI. But, this does not seem to be a easy challenge espetially with the huge seperation of interest of both parts.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	1
