3	122	\N	2023-12-16 12:18:36.569	61.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/5/SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "05-07-2024 07:07:34", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>Start:</p>\n<p>Recent statictics shows that more than 80% of business organisations migrate to the AI-based systems in order to improve and facilitate theier work envirement. The AI-based systems became an emergency in any business organisation, it helps the campany to renforce relationships, to emprove work envirement and to be more competitive within dynamic market envirement.</p>\n<p>Good relationship between the employee and the employer is one of the most important keys for a successful organisation. The AI-based systems facilitate communication between depatrments and generate databases of humain resources. The intelligent system of communication, and the possibility of asking and corporation, improve the interaction between employee and employer.</p>\n<p>The competitive market force the company to integrate the AI-based systems to collect informations about customer satisfaction and experiences. It can provide statistics and intelligent strategies to push the company to better productivity. Integration of AI-based systems aims to make jobs more meaningful. It helps to be more freindly with technology and tasks organisation for a best time planification.</p>\n<p>On the other hand, intelligent systems can be painful and stressful. The fact that you have to increase productivity can create a competitive envirement between colleges which causes an unhealthy atmospher at work.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>AI-based systems is a nessicity at work in condition of the intelligent integration. The relationship between technology and people must be well presented in order to facilitate the integration and help them to use it well.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>End/</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
