10	121	\N	2023-12-16 12:36:49.643	58.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "121", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/12/SESSION_121_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "10-05-2024 13:55:50", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Francais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; Travailler dans un environement de qualit&eacute; ou dans un environement toxique ? On consid&eacute;re que le travail est la source principale pour gagner de l'argent, c'est pour cela que le code du travail a cr&eacute;er la notion de QVCT "Qualit&eacute; de Vie et les Conditions de Travail". L'entreprise qui s'implique dans la vie personelle des employ&eacute;es favorise l'engagement de ces derniers ce qui augmente leurs performances. D'autre part, l'inter&ecirc;t pour l'&eacute;volution de carrier de chaque employ&eacute; est aussi important pour avoir une bonne qualit&eacute; de vie.</p>\n<p>On ne peux pas conna&icirc;tre ce que les autres peuvent endurer dans leur vie personnelle, l'entreprise qui aide ces collaborateurs dans ces moments critiques gagnera en terme de performance. Dans le livre "Dream Manager" de Mathew Kelly, l'entreprise qui cherche &agrave; aider les employ&eacute;es &agrave; realiser leurs r&ecirc;ves gagnera en terme de performance grace &agrave; un environnement sain. Depuis, les entreprises ont commenc&eacute; &agrave; cr&eacute;er des formations et des suivis individuelles pour guider leurs collaborateurs &agrave; r&eacute;aliser leurs r&ecirc;ves et partager leurs joix.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; En seconds lieu, l'&eacute;volution de carrier est une chose importante pour chaque salari&eacute;s, c'est pour cela que plusieurs entreprise cherche &agrave; faire des formations pour ces collaborateurs, d'ou la naissance des formations en soft skills. La majorit&eacute; des entreprises aide les employ&eacute;es &agrave; avoir des certifications dans des domaines vari&eacute;s, comme indiqu&eacute; dans l'article de Robin Sharma sur LinkedIn.</p>\n<p>Cependant, les employ&eacute;es qui donnent leur vie et leur temps pour l'entreprise et qui ne re&ccedil;oit rien en retour, ils vont commencer &agrave; chercher un autre environnement de travail. Selon l'article de journal publier sur business, la majorit&eacute; des salari&eacute;es quite leurs postes non pas &agrave; cause du salaire mais &agrave; cause de l'environement de travail. Ce n'est pas que le salaire est moin important mais que le l'environnement est plus important que le salaire.</p>\n<p>Pour assurer la qualit&eacute; de vie et les bonnes conditions de travail, il faux d'une part que l'entreprise facilite la vie pour les salari&eacute;s et les faire &eacute;voluer dans leur carri&eacute;re d'autre part en essayant de les fid&eacute;liser et s'interesser aux probl&eacute;mes de vie quotidienne ou majeur. Mais pourquoi les personnes quittent leur travail malgr&eacute; que l'entreprise &agrave; de bonnes conditions de travail et assure une bonne qualit&eacute; de vie ?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
52	2111	\N	2024-05-30 14:08:15.901	54.50	[{"id": 4, "kind": "2111", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/55/SESSION_2111_4.mp4", "size": "21130.56 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "30-05-2024 14:08:15", "dateUpload": "30-05-2024 14:07:54", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Les listes simplement chainées final.mp4", "dateTelechargement": null}, {"id": 5, "kind": "2111", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/55/SESSION_2111_5.pdf", "size": "9.14 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "30-05-2024 14:08:15", "dateUpload": "30-05-2024 14:08:09", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Capsules francais 2.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	\N	SOUMETTRE	\N	\N
47	31	2024-07-01 10:27:10.088	2024-03-18 16:30:49.576	146.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "31", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/50/SESSION_31_1.pdf", "size": "40329.77 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "18-03-2024 16:30:49", "dateUpload": "18-03-2024 16:23:02", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dossier de candidature_PG_EF_MED_ALI_AYADI.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	\N	SOUMETTRE	\N	\N
10	122	\N	2023-12-16 12:36:49.65	63.33	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/12/SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "13-05-2024 10:13:18", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>Will AI change our life for ever ? In this time, many plateformes based on AI are changing peoples life in many domains like work, relationship, technology, marketing and many more. Some people look at it in a way revolutionary technologie that can help them achieve higher goals and making life easy to become more focus on the important things in life. Others thinks that it will take they job and reduce commincation between peoples.</p>\n<p>The first part of people think that AI will make life easy by having removing repetetive jobs, for example programing skills, translator, marketing etc. A statistique shows that the use of ChatGpt is underwhelming in this and last year for developpers all around the globe, in NewYorkTimes. Also in many social media, the use of generative AI tools to create avatar that can speak about a certain product or company are used very often. This will have an impact on how people interfact with this new world of technology, by using the generative AI to help them be more focus on other things like management and acheving mor goals in life.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The other group of people are afraid of this technology, they see it as a way of been dangerous to the world and will take they jobs.In an interview, Elon musk stated that AI is dangerous if it is not controlled by humans. As far as human have controle over the AI people will be safe.</p>\n<p>Human are always afraid of something new, specially in the technologie domaine. The first apperance of Google search engine, people look at it the same way they look at AI now. And after many years of the use and the benefit that has given them, they changed their perspective and started to adopt this new tech.</p>\n<p>In the end, AI based systems will change of how people live and interact for sure, and not only people but companies as well, but what kind of technologies will come in the future ? And What if AI is used the wrong way ?</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
37	122	\N	2023-12-16 12:24:40.767	26.33	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/40/SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "17-05-2024 11:55:33", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;AI based systems becomes more and more popular. In fact, it has many effects not only on nature of jobs but also on relationship.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; We can say that AI make our life easier. Since, it facilates many jobs and many tasks. For example, Chat GPT can provide codes can also provide advices, gide of uses. It can also help you to give a synonyms.</p>\n<p>However, using AI without controle without roles has many ethics.</p>\n<p>AI can't remplace human intelligence. It can only be seen as a technology that help emplyers and emplyees.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; So, the emergency of AI- based systems hase adavantages and desadvantages. That, is why we should know how and when use it.</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
