13	122	\N	2023-12-16 12:29:17.035	34.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/15/SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "17-05-2024 12:23:18", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Engineering problems are becoming more complex and multifaceted, often termed &lsquo;wicked&rsquo; problems. For this problem, we nedded a future generations of engineers to propose a solution to deal these complex societal challenges.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Future generations of engineers will not only be catalysts of technical innovation but will also play a leading role in addressing various social issues. They will need to apply a holistic view, considering concepts such as context, complexity, uncertainty, risk or ethics. So, this opinion necessited other solutions from the future engineers need to be equipped with a new set of competences.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>But, this opinion are not valideted if you the future engineers not confirmed your competences. For this point, we need to ameliorate and to apply a holistic view, considering concepts such as context, complexity, uncertainty, risk or ethics.</p>\n<p>For my opinion in the engineering problems, many factory of the substainabal golas devellopement. In this contexte, i proposed to integrate the 17 goals of substainabal devellopement from ameliorate a engineering educated .</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Finally, thus, in order to deal with these complex and global societal challenges, future engineers need to be equipped with a new set of competences.&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	1
