21	122	\N	2023-12-16 12:37:01.893	58.33	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/23/SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "13-05-2024 10:45:31", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Start</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Future engineering genrations&nbsp; problems such as context, complexity, risk and ethics have been an issue of heated debate all over the world since we started to talk about Z-generations. In fact, with the emergency of new technologies, in particular AI tools and emerging chatbots , a future engineer is not challenged by the technical innovation but also by his impact as a human being to enhace the life quality and to address global societal issues. Some people believe that the role of a future engineer will become more complex because he should meet his genration needs in both sides: technical side and societal side. Others are completely against and think that the only chanllenge an engineer should deal with is how to make new discoveries and implement innovative solutions.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Due to the technical innovation, engineering problems are duplicated and every future engineer should multiface various issues in different sides. For this reason, future generations of engineers will learn how to deal with these issues to be up to date with the numerous technologies. Hence, they will not have time to "silly things" such as staying with their families, taking dinner with their children,.. Besides, living in a fast world makes a future engineer responsible of looking for solutions for every problem wherever it occurs. Being connected all over the time can impact every humain being, specially an engineer who is connected during the whole day which prevent him to practice an ordinary social live. Havin all the time virtual relationships due the nature of his work, behind a little screen, can impact his relationship in the real world and change the future ingineer to be shy, anti-social and sometimes, may be he needs to have a psychological treatement.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; On the other hand, some people believe that working on new projects&nbsp; and learning new technologies is the only way to succeed in their professionnel career in order to provide innovative solutions and play a leading role in addressing the challenged issues all over the world. The peoples who succeed to establish a great civilization is those who were making new accomplishments.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;There are a third group of people that think that these upcoming generations of engineers should strength their skills in both sides: technical skills, soft skills and societal skills. In fact, having safe families produce safe individuals that are not looking for affection to feel stability. In order to lead the world, as human being, engineers should respect ethics to meet their requirements without compromising the needs of the next generations.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; To conclude, future engineers need to enhance their&nbsp; personnal competences and be equipped with a new set of skills to be catalysts of the technical innovation and also to deal with the global societal challenges. But, this debate will always continue.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>End</strong></span></p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	1
