32	122	\N	2024-04-18 11:02:09.047	75.33	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/35/SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "16-05-2024 15:59:56", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Since Alain Turing and its "Bomb" till nowadays, the technological innovation is one of the most urgent subject.</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">One of the forms of this progress is the artificial intelligence (AI).</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">In fact, this AI is present in all the personal and professional fields.</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">All the organisations are also concerned by this innovation and try to integrate it in their management, especially the business organisations.</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">How can this AI impact and transform the management whithin these business organisations?</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;National and international business organisation are, more and more obliged to integrate the technoligical innovation in their management and production processes.</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">In fact, this AI help this organisation to maximise their productivity because they can use these technologies in doing hard and unsafe tasks, so that he employees will be delivered and more safe.</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">This will let the employees to be more comfortable at work and their relationship with their employers will be better.</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">This technologies can positively impact also the relationship between tke organisation and its customres because they can have the deliverables they want in a shorter delay and, even, iwith better quality.</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">Thus, the firm can win an competitive advantage in its market environment and even be leader.</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;But it's important to&nbsp; pay attention to the use of these technologies because they can give negative impact, especially concerning the replacement of the workforce.</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">Many firms&nbsp; try to replace the AI instead its employees, so that, it will caus more unlabour.</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">In addition, we musn't forget that this AI can never take the place of the human relationships because we can't leave without feelings and interactive relationships.</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Certainely, the technological innovation, especially the artificial intelligence can be a good tool to help the business organisations to ameliorate their profits and notoriety.</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">It can, even, help the firms to have a corporate social responsibility ( CSR) because it can provide the firm to have economic, social and environmental finality.</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">But, it's very important to be carefull to the use this technology, otherwise it can cause negative impacts on the firm and specially on the employees.</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">All the&nbsp; managers must know that there are many fiels wher human beings can't be replaced, especially in the fields that require from us relationships based on feelings.</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">Otherwise, the chatbots can take our place in the personnal or professional fields and we can be part of "The Transformers" of JamesCameroun, in the real life.</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
