11	122	\N	2023-12-16 12:33:01.43	23.33	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/13/SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "05-07-2024 07:11:57", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>Engineering problems are becomming more complex and multifaced. In fact future generations of engineers will not only be catalysts of technical innovations but will also play a leading role in addressing various social issues. They will need to apply a holistic view, considering concepts such as context, complexity, uncertainty, risk or ethics. Then, futur engineers need to be equipped with a new set of competences as machines learning and more new pragramms wich facilite the lifes of them.</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	1
