6	122	\N	2023-12-16 12:37:50.138	62.67	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/8/SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "16-05-2024 15:44:06", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Nowadays, engineers are facing more and more problems at work, because they are doing their jobs in term of engineering, developping , solving technical problems, production, etc...and of cours, engineers should be aware about the evolution of technologie and the requierements of the society. Not only this, but they should be leader, preventative and constantly in progress. It can be the role of education engineering to put on future engineers other skills to be used in the professionnal world.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>To what extend is the engineering eductaion playing a role in having future engineers a new set of competences in order to be a good polyvalent engineer?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; We can not ignore the hard work done by engineers to achieve their goals or the goals made by the firm or the society. his effort should be developed continously to insure the efficiency of the work.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; In&nbsp; one hand, the engineering education is the first source of making future curious engineers and put on them the ability to discover and solve problems in a short time, whitch define an operational good engineer, but also, engineering education should be aligned with the world progress and afford more and more competences to future engineers and shouldn't be restricted to educate only technical and scientific issus. It should go far away and highlits other important skills relating to the work.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; For example, since the maiden release into the public domain on November 30,2023, the Chatgpt has integrated more then one million subscribers in a week. This event has took by surprise the world, because it shows its extraordinary abilitiy to solve complex tasks, which is in reality the job done by engineers. Here, we should say that a future engineer during his study or an engineer who is working should be aware of this invention and pick up the advantages and the good part of the artificial intelligence and avoid the disadvantages of it to help him in his work. And here we can highlight the integration of this invention into the engineering education.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Added to that, we cannot ignore the implication and the engagement of many countries in the plan done by the UNESCO which define 17 development goals, called The 17 SDGs, and try to achieve them by the end of 2030. An enginner must be aware and should respct this strategical chart while he is working.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>For example, in construction, an architect and and a civil engineer must use ecological materials and recyclable ones because they are not degaging gangerous gas and also use renewable energy and natural ressources to decrease the loss of energy as possible. So Sustainable development and sustainability should be implicated in engineering education to be a part of future engineering competences.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;In the other hand, engineer with a set of new competences, added to technological one, can lead to work in pression and under stress and requier a capability to cover his tasks correctly. And, managing all this global societal challenging is to hard for a human. It can affect the well being at work in specific and the efficacity of the engenner in general.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;To conclude, to be a good engineer, we should be aligned with the requirement of the society and be awre of the progression in many other domain, It's true that the education engineering is playing an important role to concreticize this, but also, the engineer should be volunteer and engaged, and should apply an effort to have new skills and competences that make him shining in all aspects.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	1
