2	122	\N	2023-12-16 12:37:24.046	62.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/4/SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "16-05-2024 16:06:13", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Artificial intelligence is nowdays the biggest evolution in most firms ans factories , this thechnolgy is beginnig to appear in many fields ; manufacturing , education , art ...But the question that we may ask is : what are the impacts of the AI on the meaning of jobs and the relations between all the elements in a firm or a socity ?</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">To be fair , we can say that AI has two sides , a good one and a bad one. Let's first talk about the positive side . AI-based systems can clearly make easier the process of work in many fiels , some steps in an operation may be delegated to a machine to be done . In terms of creativity , AI could give us some ideas , for example in cars manufacturing it could propose a new design , in the case of mode , it could give us a new imagination of a piece of clothes. Of corse , the results generated by the AI algorithms must be filtrated and enhanced by the worker in that specefic position so that we avoid divergent or non ethical outputs. These new ideas , designs in a very short time may lead to maximaze the satisfaction of the customer giving him a large choice of features . That can only make emplyoers more happy about theirs employees.</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">Although AI has many benefits , people must not totaly rely on it , and even when they use it they must be sure they master the proper knowledge and steps to realize one operation or another . This leads us to talk about education : the fact that AI can give us easly some results must not make us change the way our students are formed , they must have all the necessary formation and practice to be efficient in a certain field . Now let's talk the use of AI in education , yes it can be used in some ways, for example to calculate when calculating is not a goal by it self .It can also be used to genrate some new ideas when students are demandes to create new designs in the mechanical field...</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">It must be said , that the most dangerous effect of AI is when it is used too much, it can lead to many employees without jobs . That could significantly transform work force demographics ; this matter in not to be thought about from a productivity or material view , but also from a human , moral and ethical view , employers must find equilibrium between the two sides.</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">As a conclusion , we can say that AI can make work easier and probably more productive but people should not totaly rely on it , and they must not be replaced by it.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
