66	22	\N	2025-02-16 02:33:35.563	88.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "22", "path": "2\\\\155\\\\SESSION_22_1.pdf", "size": "10459.1 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "16-02-2025 02:33:35", "dateUpload": "11-02-2025 22:20:17", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "peer_reviewed_articles_AhmedAMMAR.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}, {"id": 2, "kind": "22", "path": "2\\\\155\\\\SESSION_22_2.pdf", "size": "17928.37 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "16-02-2025 02:33:35", "dateUpload": "11-02-2025 22:31:59", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Conférences.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}, {"id": 3, "kind": "22", "path": "2\\\\155\\\\SESSION_22_3.pdf", "size": "64906.12 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "16-02-2025 02:33:35", "dateUpload": "11-02-2025 22:37:13", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "(Multidisciplinary and applied optics) Ammar, Ahmed_ Lakshminarayanan, Vasudevan_ Varadharajan, L. Srinivasa - Understanding optics with Python-CRC Press (2017).pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	\N	SOUMETTRE	\N	\N
108	122	\N	2024-12-23 12:46:10.913	42.50	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\30\\\\SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "24-02-2025 20:25:52", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>The emergence of innovative technologies in particulary Smartphones which&nbsp; has&nbsp; revolutionized the way of&nbsp; interacting with the world by&nbsp; embodying a convergence of communication, information, and entertainment tools. In this context, the&nbsp; smartphones became the princiapl tools in our daily lives&nbsp; in terms of communication,entertainment&nbsp; as well as the source of knowlege&nbsp; Howener, this addiction of technology may raise &nbsp;interpersonal relationships issues and professional environments gaps. From this perspective,&nbsp; a deep analysis among its positifs impacts and its risks , is required to provide a complete balance between the good practice&nbsp; and&nbsp; the tasks to be avoided.</p>\n<p>With the emergence of the innovative technologies&nbsp; and the revolution of IA driven tools , the smartphones became the mainly way adopted by all generation in numerous practices in particulary&nbsp; &nbsp;for the communication, entertainment and develp skills and knowlege.</p>\n<p>In one hand,&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
47	21212	\N	2024-06-03 12:07:59.564	76.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "21212", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/50/SESSION_21212_1.pdf", "size": "393.83 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "03-06-2024 12:07:59", "dateUpload": "19-02-2024 09:50:11", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Document sequence.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}, {"id": 2, "kind": "21212", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/50/SESSION_21212_2.pdf", "size": "40.42 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "03-06-2024 12:07:59", "dateUpload": "19-02-2024 18:34:37", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "lien_capsule_sequence.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	\N	SOUMETTRE	\N	\N
33	122	\N	2023-12-16 12:37:59.772	66.17	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/36/SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "05-07-2024 07:26:42", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>Artificial intellingence, the new famous word that we hear almost every day in every field. Many questions about this new technology, most of poeple are curious and want to understand more about it. It is certain that the AI is becoming a part of our life and we have to learn how&nbsp; to deal with it in every aspect.</p>\n<p>The emergence of AI-based systems in the business organisation is becoming a fact, and many changes are related to the employement of this technology, in a positive and in a negative way. It is certain that the emergence of AI has many advantages especially in doing the business work in a very short amount of time with a high quality level of work but on the other hand, many problems the modern society is going to face, this emergence will significantly transform work force demographics, indeed, many persons are going to loose their jobs which is a major problem, besides many poeple don't understand yet this technology so how can they use it especially the old persons. With the employement of the AI, they will be not a humain relation between persons, it will becoming a relation between robots, many persons don't find it easy since they are used to communicate with humain beeing and get explained answers form persons like them.</p>\n<p>With the competitive dynamic world that we are leaving, the emergence of AI will include every field without any exception. The question is how can prepare poeple to these major transformations and does it going to be a global tranformations, poor countries are they able to apply the AI.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
43	122	\N	2023-12-16 12:33:47.477	71.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/46/SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "05-07-2024 07:30:11", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>The rapid evolution of information technologies has opened up a new persepectives such as the relationship between people and technology. The use of languge models developed by open AI offers a number of opportinuity for example, it makes a significant developpement of customer experience and competitive advantage within dynamic market environment. Nevertheless, it raises concerns.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>In this first part, we will see the adavantages of integrating AI&nbsp; in the business organisations, it 's provides an important assistance to customer and employer, offring a responses to their specific questions. The uses of language models enables to perform an integration of employer. In this context, the emergence of AI has a significant advantages by generating a number of ideas that can develop and solve the differents problems at work.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>In the second part, we will see the disadvantages of the emergence of AI in business organisations, it can provied an incomplet information or missing information. The use of AI must be guided by human supervisor. In fact, the reliability of responses&nbsp; must be ortiented by humain ressource. In this context, the uses of AI enables to develop disadvantages in the relationship between people and technology.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The ermergence of AI has a number of significant advantages in busniness organisations but also raises important questions. It 's crucial to makes a balance between the evolution of information technologies and the professionnal fondamental values.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
