16	2112	\N	2024-05-30 12:24:50.707	68.00	[{"id": 3, "kind": "2112", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/18/SESSION_2112_3.pdf", "size": "70.1 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "30-05-2024 12:24:50", "dateUpload": "30-05-2024 12:22:24", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Description-Capsule-Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}, {"id": 4, "kind": "2112", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/18/SESSION_2112_4.mp4", "size": "153262.34 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "30-05-2024 12:24:50", "dateUpload": "30-05-2024 12:23:25", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Capsule-Anglais.mp4", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	\N	SOUMETTRE	\N	\N
62	122	\N	2024-12-23 12:44:05.607	77.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\166\\\\SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "18-02-2025 13:52:07", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;In a globalized word, technology usage is no more an optional decision. Technological devises are part of our daily lives and they are omipresent in different tasks that we undertake. One of these devises is the smartphone which is considered as a helpful tool for individuals. Yet, different concerns raise behind the excessive use of such tools.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Smartphones facilitate the access to information, they help to gain in terms of time and efforts allowing people to manage effectively and efficiently their scheduales. For example, the calendar provides a clear and easy way to plan, organize and control our activities.</p>\n<p>Furthermore, smartphones play the role of a reliable communication technique. For instance, a user can easily share urgent information with regard to a specific event or meeting with a high number of individuals. Thus, these devises hamper people from forgetting to share a message with the target audience.</p>\n<p>In addition, smartphones are considered as an entertainement tool because they offer a variety of services such as the gaming ones. For instance, while smartphone users are waiting for the bus or the metro, they can play in real time with their relatives or friends. They are not obliged to wait until their arrival to home to do so.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Nevertheless, the use of these devises is questionable. In fact, several studies revealed the significant linkage between the use of smaartphoes and the addiction or even other psychological issues.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>According to a study by some scholars, using excessively smartphones may lead to weaken our memory. These scholars did their experiment with the users of TikTok. They found that the brain will be used to see short content. Consequently, the user focus will be low when facing long content such as a long text or a long video.</p>\n<p>Besides, the pervasive presence of these tools in our daily life may lead to reduce real interactions with family members and only focusing on virtual ones. This may create a separate world which is far from relaity.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;It is fundamental to recognize the pitfalls of using smartphones. But, shaping some guidelines to use effectively the smartphones is interesting and it contributes to value the outcomes of their usage rather then generating serious problems. Accordingly,&nbsp; time management is required to excert control over the negative impact of this pervasive presence. Then, it is essential to emphasize the advantages behind using responsibly and ethically these devises. When it comes to the mentionned concerns, a set of recommendations and directions can be relevant to solve related problems.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; In conclusion, technology is key in a fast changing environement. It is crucial not only to embrace technological changes but also to know how to deal with their concerns. Following a proactive approach allows to observe, analyse and predict these changes and to design strategies that allign with the behavioral aspects of these technological changes. How can society leverage between a responsible use of smartphones and the privacy concerns?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
