36	111	\N	\N	59.63	[{"id": 1, "kind": "111", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/39/SESSION_111_1.pdf", "size": "0 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": null, "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "QCMProduction.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}, {"id": 2, "kind": "111", "path": "https://grade.esprit.tn/webservice/pluginfile.php/10220/mod_resource/content/1/FicheModule.pdf/?forcedownload=1&token=d1d32de402aa7927638bfca5d0fa6b64", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": null, "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "FicheModule.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}, {"id": 3, "kind": "111", "path": "https://grade.esprit.tn/webservice/pluginfile.php/10293/mod_resource/content/1/DescriptifQCM.pdf/?forcedownload=1&token=d1d32de402aa7927638bfca5d0fa6b64", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": null, "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "DescriptifQCM.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	\N	SOUMETTRE	\N	\N
26	122	\N	2023-12-16 12:36:42.736	52.33	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/29/SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "17-05-2024 11:35:28", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>Nowadays,all the business organisations are moving on to use of IA-based systems,specially in the market environment that needs to usually offer the best customer experience.</p>\n<p>However,the user profiling systems and the systems of recommandation can help to deal with all the customers.It will collect the data of every single click of every single user, then this collected data will be analysed with IA algorithms to make results that contains the wishes of everyone and his preferred artciles.For example Jumia is the biggest business organisation that uses in their background web site this type of algorithms to create a profile for each oneand then provides the suitables product and offers to them in their next visit.</p>\n<p>Also,Netflix is the powerful provider of best movie nights experience to the customers, because it uses the best Big Data Analytics to store their user behaviour that helps to create the best recomandation systems who can guaranties the best movies suggestions per user.</p>\n<p>The use of this AI-based systems,may cause a problem because they can't guarantie the user Privacy.This systems uses a sensitive data like user phone location without a direct permision.There are also algorithms in background that can track every single on-line click of every user in social media to collect data like the user reacts,their comments that may contains some feedbacks or reactions of products,and even more.This data is supposed to be private and protected but they can easelly share it with other business organisation to help them making recomandations in their social media publishs.</p>\n<p>So finally,we can say that AI-based systems can make profits to the business organisations within dynamic market environment,and the user Privacy still a challenge that needs to achieve.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
