46	122	\N	2024-04-18 11:38:10.333	36.33	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/1/49/SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "17-05-2024 12:07:14", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; In the recent decades, AI become an important subject for all the domain of our life, such as business, IT, medecine,....So, how the emergence of AI-based systems in the business organisations can transform work force demographics, nature and meaningfulness of job, employer-employee relationship, relationship between people and technology?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; AI can replace human in the organisation. All the taskes will be executed automaticully by algorithms based on AI. So employee will only supervise the execution of the process and be sur that is correctly terminated.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; The use of AI, can make better the relationship between employer employee. The employee has not a lot of taskes so he has not stress and he can do her best in work. The employee search more good idea of marketing.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;According to the AI, employee are more confortable in the use of the technology&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
