83	122	\N	2024-12-23 12:44:36.084	70.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\139\\\\SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "24-02-2025 10:14:22", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>Nowerdays, </strong>the technology takes a crucial place in our lives, for example, Smartphones as a tool in the modern technology, has become a necessity in the life of everyone. The majority of people says that the Smartphone has only benfits, but other says that this tool maybe will destroy our lives. The next part of this work will discuss these two ideas. First we will developp the opinion of those who are with smartphones and secondly we will adopt the opinion of the second group.</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong> &nbsp; First</strong>, Smartphones have many benefits in our <strong>study</strong>, for example it helps students and teachers to connect easly to internet and to search informations, papers, researches and applications without spending time or money to buy expensive tools such as computers.&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Also,</strong> it helps everybody to finish his <strong>work, </strong>to comunicate with his consumers or to deal with other people in any place without spending time or money on transport. Giving the example of a bisnessman taking his car and going visiting his family, another bisnessman would like to communicate with him to deal about a very important projetct, in this case smartphones help these two binsessmen to finish and validate the deal.</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Moreover</strong>, Smarthones improve the<strong> communication between people</strong>, everone can with his smartphone communicate with other people without going visiting them in reality and this can help us to have many friends and to communicate with them always and at any time. If we have a probleme we can call everyone also, for example a grandmother lives alone and oneday, she feels tired&nbsp; so how she can call her sons and daughters without smartphone. It really make our lives so easy.</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Furthermore</strong>, Smartphones, make our life easier. With it, we can treat our bills, buying online, doing reservation on hotels and callig police. A real example can improve this idea, taking the example of a women, staying at her house and caring about his two babies, she likes to buy some fruits an vegetables to prepare his lunch also her husband is at work, in this cas she can use her Smartphone to call the supermarket and finish this deal in few seconds.</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; However,</strong> some people says that using always smartphones can decrease, for example, the abiliy of students in thinking, seraching so their level will decrease. <strong>Also </strong>spending a lot of time using smartphones will destroy the relationship between the memebrer of our families, for example, each evneing every member of the family is concentrated only on his smartphone without talking with the othe members of his family, so how can father understund his son and how can the son undestand his mother or father. <strong>But,</strong> we can say that this probleme is not due to the smartphone, the probleme is in our minds and in our culture of the use of this tool. So parents should teach their children how to correctly use smartphones and why not the countries use&nbsp; their media to talk about the best use of smarthones.</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;As a conclusion</strong>, any device&nbsp; in this world has benifts and it has also negatif effects, so everyone should know how to use this. <strong>As i look at the future</strong>, A nice use of smartphones can make all people agree with this tool.&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
