90	31	2025-07-10 11:23:59.672	2025-07-10 16:06:04.623	85.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "31", "path": "2\\\\16\\\\SESSION_31_1.pdf", "size": "10026.09 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "10-07-2025 16:06:04", "dateUpload": "18-03-2025 21:44:21", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Rapport_final_à_déposer_Mounira_pg2425.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	\N	SOUMETTRE	\N	\N
61	121	\N	2024-12-23 12:45:43.062	61.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "121", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\147\\\\SESSION_121_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "29-04-2025 10:48:31", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Francais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>La r&eacute;silience, le fait d'&ecirc;tre capable &agrave; se d&eacute;fendre, &agrave; confronter, &agrave; supporter, &agrave; surmonter, &agrave; convaincre et &agrave; s'exprimer est un sujet qui a suscit&eacute; des d&eacute;bats.</p>\n<p>Certains pensent que la cl&eacute; de la r&eacute;silience est l'activit&eacute; physique et d'autres pensent qu'elle est aquise par l'activit&eacute; mentale, ou l'activit&eacute; &eacute;motionelle ou l'activit&eacute; sociale.</p>\n<p>Alors la question qui se pose c'est de savoir comment r&eacute;element l'&ecirc;tre humain devient-il r&eacute;siliant ?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>La r&eacute;silience ne s'h&eacute;rite pas, c'est une capacit&eacute;, une richesse qu'on la construit, petit &agrave; petit, en rencontrant les &eacute;preuves de la vie et on d&eacute;couvrant ses facettes pour qu'on puisse continuer &agrave; avancer, &agrave; &eacute;voluer et &agrave; construire la meilleur version de nous m&ecirc;me.</p>\n<p>Cetains d&eacute;fendent que la r&eacute;silience est aquise par la lecture, en se r&eacute;f&eacute;rant &agrave; des romans, des livres, des articles etc ...</p>\n<p>D'autres exigent que la r&eacute;silience est obtenue en s'integrant dans la vie social, en partagant les exp&eacute;riences, les v&eacute;&ccedil;us, les id&eacute;es ... Par exemple, personellement, en int&eacute;grant un club associatif, j'ai appris &agrave; surmonter les probl&eacute;mes, les d&eacute;fis, &agrave; travailler en &eacute;quipe, &agrave; collaborer ensemble, &agrave; discuter et surtout &agrave; partager la m&ecirc;me vision et le m&ecirc;me objectif. Tout &ccedil;a m'a aid&eacute; aujoud'hui &agrave; enrechir mes connaissances et a avoir un profil solide qui me permettra de faire face &agrave; plusieurs &eacute;preuves dont je suis capable.</p>\n<p>Toutefois, la r&eacute;silience peut nous nuire et nous balancer dans un monde de haine, o&ugrave; les gens r&eacute;agissent avec m&eacute;chancet&eacute; en croyant que leurs r&eacute;siliences leur permettent d'avoir un sens de superiorit&eacute; par rapport aux autrui.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Mais, malgr&eacute;s &ccedil;a, les avantages de la r&eacute;siliance surpasse de loin ses inconv&eacute;nients, par exemple, la r&eacute;silience nous permettra d'avoir une forte personnalit&eacute; capable de surmonter toutes les d&eacute;fis.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Pour conclure, la r&eacute;silience est une capacit&eacute; primoridiale pour l'&ecirc;tre humain pour qu'il puisse confronter la vie dans toutes ses &eacute;tats, pour le meilleur comme pour le pire, dans les hauts et dans les bas.</p>\n<p>Essayons-nous donc de renforcer notre r&eacute;silience pour pouvoir vivre en paix.&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	1
94	122	\N	2024-12-23 12:46:46.573	56.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\31\\\\SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "24-02-2025 20:34:04", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;The use of the new technologies such as Smartphones have an impact of the way to interact with the world around us, also whith the&nbsp; relationships between pepole. This impact could be positif or negatif if it will be an addiction. We will discuss in this desrtation the impact of the smartphones in our live. First, we begin by presenting the impact of using Smartphones in our interpersonal relationsips and secondly, in our professional environments.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; The use of smartphones is depending on what it is used for or how to used it and what application installed on it. The smartphone addiction gives birth of many problems such as communication problems, problems in their social live and healthcare problems. For example, nowadays,&nbsp; as a popular application we can mentioned Instaragam , we can found that the most of people using this application are addicted to it. First, they spend hours without doing nothing juste watching stories and reels or communicating with virtual persons by using their smartpones. Second, they have&nbsp; a problem to communicat and discuss in real life with pepole. Finnaly, they can have problem on their eyes shuch as hey spend time for just watching on it.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The smartphones adiction in our professional envirements it's depending on how used it. We can use smarphones to inrease our productivity in ourwork and evalute professionnaly esspetially if our work is in the area of IT. Adding to the disadvanteges for using Instagram for a simple user, we can mentionned that it coud be an advantege for how used it such as a tool for professional live and job. By ysing smartphones all the day, they spend all the time to communicat and gives idea to thers followers. They have the possibility to paratage information idea and at the same time take money fram sponsered.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;We conclude that the use of the smartphones couls be an advantges for&nbsp; someoine how konw how to used it correcctly .&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
