80	122	\N	2024-12-23 12:47:11.461	50.50	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\135\\\\SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "24-02-2025 11:20:45", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>Nowadays, smartphones has a crucial role in our daily lives for many reasons .However, their pervasive presence has a negative reflects.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>First of all, many children use smartphones to communicate with their parents, so they can not be scared about them if they come back home later for example , so it is the great way to have some assurance, moreover, it is simple to use it facilitates the researches in their projects so they do not have need personal computer or something like that. However, many of them are addicted to smartphones , so they do not communicate with people at all if they are in need , google become their freind .In this way, the relationships decrement every day.</p>\n<p>Added to that, in the health field, smartphones can be a solution , many persons who have disease urgently they can communicate with their doctors to come.</p>\n<p>In conclusion, smartphones have either positive and negative effects. So their pervasive presence in our daily lives raises concerns about smartphone addiction and its ramification for interpersonal relationships.&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
