80	121	\N	2024-12-23 12:47:09.764	43.50	[{"id": 1, "kind": "121", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\135\\\\SESSION_121_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "29-04-2025 11:42:31", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Francais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>Imaginons qu'une maman va donner naissance &agrave; son premier b&eacute;b&eacute; ,frustr&eacute;e et au meme temps impatiente pour donner une vie &agrave; un etre humain ,de ce fait ,les activit&eacute;s sociales, physiques, mentales et &eacute;motionnelles jouent un role crucial pour supporter psychiquement cette &eacute;preuve de la vie.</p>\n<p>Comment savoir alors le degr&egrave;s d'importance de ses derni&egrave;res pour certains individus que pour d'autres?</p>\n<p>Pour commencer,dans le domaine de la sant&eacute;, les &eacute;motions des medecins envers leurs patients ont un impact positif et un pourcentage important pour leur gu&eacute;rison.Par exemple, une personne qui souffre d'un cancer a vaiment besoin d'un &eacute;quilibre &eacute;motionnel pour surmonter sa maladie ainsi r&eacute;ussir cette mauvaise &eacute;preuve de la vie en quelques sorte.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Concernant le domaine du sport , le succ&egrave;s national et international de certains joueurs comme YOUSSEF msekni le joueur tunisien de foot, ainsi HABIBA ghribi l'athl&egrave;te tunisienne et ONS Jabeur la championne du tennis refl&eacute;te leurs efforts physiques fournis tout au long leurs parcours .On ne peut pas donc nier l'importance de l'activit&eacute; physique pour franchir ces &eacute;preuves de la vies li&egrave;es &agrave; leurs m&eacute;tiers.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Pour d'autre , avoir des activit&eacute;s sociales est primordial et &ccedil;a leur permet de surmonter les d&eacute;fis de la vie .</p>\n<p>En conclusion, surmonter les d&eacute;fis de la vie exige d'avoir le m&eacute;lange entre les d'activit&eacute;s quelque soit mentale ,&eacute;motionnelle sociale ou physique car il a un role efficient dans la psycologie de l'etre humain.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	1
90	122	\N	2024-12-23 12:04:16.152	46.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\16\\\\SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "24-02-2025 09:52:55", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>Artificial intelligent is transforming the world at an unprecedented pace. By enabling machines to mimic humain intelligence,</p>\n<p>Smartphones has throught innovative solutions to complex problems, resheaping industries and improving daily lives.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>However, its also poses chalanges the require careful considerations.</p>\n<p>The smartphones has positively various fields. In helthcare, assists in early&nbsp; desease detacted and personalized treatments.</p>\n<p>In education, intellegents systems adapt at students'needs, anchancing learning experiences.</p>\n<p>However, concerns about job displacment, data securty and ethical decision-maiking highlight the need for responsable AI development.</p>\n<p>Governments, companies and indivudials must collaborate for AI development.</p>\n<p>AI presents, an incredible oppertunity to solve global challanges and improve lives.&nbsp; With thoughtful regalution and ethical practices, these issues</p>\n<p>and ensure AI developments its potential&nbsp; minimizided risks.&nbsp; &nbsp;The futur of AI depends on how wisley we shape its development Today.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
63	122	\N	2024-12-23 12:43:22.045	66.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\133\\\\SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "24-02-2025 10:19:29", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Recently, the daily use of smartphone is increase. Some people praise the beneficts and the revolution of this device, while other struggle with the daily use of this device. This essay will explore the beneficts and the drawbacks of the smartphone.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; First, the smartphone can be a good tools of communication. Nowaday, everyone have at least one of his family in an other country and this device can be a simple way to talk with him.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Moreover, this small engine can be like a tiny computer, it is a good tools to research information and also to share it. The world will be a a little country and we can reach anything and everything.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; However, their pervasive presence in our daily lives can result many problems like telephone addiction. The user can be like a robot and all the day the smartphone in his hands which result a many ramifications not only with his personal realtionships, like divorce, but also with his personal environments.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;While this can be true but can be reduce with the application of the right strategies. Students and teachers used smartphone for e-learning for example. All documents can be reacheable eveywhere and anytime. Also, we can install many application that can be used for a good way like learn new language or practice sports at home. Futhermore, with smartphone we make a new relationships with people from the word wide usinf social media and we can open a new window to know the news and the culture of the others.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>In Conclusion, the revolution of smartphone help us to be connected with the world and with the good use of this device our live can be changed. With new technologies integred in smartphone like artificiel intellegent how this can be influent in our lives?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
105	121	\N	2024-12-23 12:43:09.954	31.50	[{"id": 1, "kind": "121", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\19\\\\SESSION_121_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "30-04-2025 20:00:02", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Francais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>La d&eacute;mocratie et les Droits de l&rsquo;Homme sont des slegonts que les europ&eacute;ens utilisent souvant pour d&eacute;fendre leur principes et pour &eacute;tablir l'&eacute;galiter et la stabiliter dans tous les payes du monde. Mais, vue ce qui se passe actuellement dans Gazza et plusieurs autres payes,&nbsp; des nombreuses int&eacute;rogations sont pos&eacute;es sur la d&eacute;finition exacte de la d&eacute;mocratie et les Droits de l&rsquo;Homme.</p>\n<p>Vous examinerons, d'aborad,&nbsp; la d&eacute;finion Europ&eacute;enne de la d&eacute;mocratie et &nbsp;les Droits de l&rsquo;Homme. Ensuite, nous verrons les principaux &eacute;v&eacute;nements dans le monde qui donnent une autre vison pour cette d&eacute;mocratie. Enfin, nous terminerons par une r&eacute;flexion pond&eacute;r&eacute;e.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Dans un premier plan, l'Europe se pr&eacute;sente entant que la porteuse et la d&eacute;fendeuse des Droits de l&rsquo;Homme. En effet, plusieurs lois ont &eacute;t&eacute; lanc&eacute;s par les europ&eacute;ens afin de prot&eacute;ger l'Homme et d'&eacute;tablir l'&eacute;galit&eacute; dans le monde enti&eacute;re. En plus, l'union europ&eacute;enne impose des sonctions et des p&eacute;nalit&eacute;s pour les pay&eacute;s qui ne respectent pas ces lois.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Dans un autre plan, le role le l'europe dans plusieurs gaires dans le monde pr&eacute;sente une autre d&eacute;finion de l'&eacute;galit&eacute; et du protection de lib&eacute;rt&eacute;. Par exemple, la gaire &agrave; l'Okrani et &agrave; Gazza pr&eacute;sente une appilcation non &eacute;quitable des lois du Droits de l'Homme. L'europe soutient la gaire dans okrani avec tous les moyens logictiques et strat&eacute;giques. En ravanche, la gaire de Gazza pr&eacute;sente une silence &eacute;tonnant des lois europ&eacute;enne.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>En couclusion, bienque les europ&eacute;ens ont tant l&rsquo;habitude de se p&eacute;senter en champions de la d&eacute;mocratie et les Droits de l&rsquo;Homme, la gaire en Gazza et dans des autres pay&eacute;s prouve la r&eacute;alit&eacute; de ces slegonts.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
78	122	\N	2024-12-23 12:39:54.25	62.50	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\137\\\\SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "24-02-2025 10:44:55", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>In our days, we're all need to use technologies to communicate and to share informations with our friends, family and collegues. One of this tools will be the smartphone, that has a big importance after adding to it a new technologie named WiFi in 1997. After that, smartphones has been the first component used to communicate to sahre information and the first entertainment tools using application like ( facebook, instagram, twitter and many others app). Every year, smartphones earns more and more importance and it has a significant place in our daily lives that guides us to be addict to it. That causes many problems like losing the capacity to build relations with others in real life, because we lose the capacity to make a real and a non-virtual conversations. that gives as the way to know the bad effect of using usually the smartphones to changing informations bettwen us. that makes as programmed to just use this tools in every life activities. Since adding some AI tools to smartphones, the situation became more and more complicated, we can detect that many people use smartphone to manipulate others by changing their photos and sharing it in the social media. In my opinion, smartphones kills our ability to improve our soft skills earned in our life cycle also it kills our inspiration and imagination. In my case and as a teacher, i detect many bad effects of the smartphone's addiction in my students like losing interrest. I use many solutions to solve that but i found difficulties to involve all students in the classroom and in the education process. One of this solution is to involve smartphones im my corses. So, i usually invite students to use their smartphones to do some researchs and to sharing some corses or some researchs with their collegues because i know the importance of this tool and i convert the bad points of it to be one my corse's tools. Finally, we have two ways to use smartphones the first is just using it to make virtual conversations and to share informations. the second way is to using ti with moderation to avoiding the addiction and we can convert the bad issues of using this tools to some good things can help us in our real life.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
75	122	\N	2024-12-23 12:45:07.399	73.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\138\\\\SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "24-02-2025 10:34:26", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Was our lives before smartphones the same as ou lives nowadays ? It is crucial to mention that technology embodied the word so that we cannot live without smart devices and this appears in many domains like education, industry, banking... Hence, we always need our smartphones to keep in touch with the world. However, the overuse of these tools may be somewhat dangerous if we can not manipulate it conviniously. In this essay, we will try to discover the main advantages and disadvantages of the presence of smartphones in our lives.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; To begin with, smartphones are showing us consistantly an evolution on all its ways. The most use of these devices is well seen when we can communicatie with our family, friends and colleagues who are miles away from us. Added to that, they are making our lives joyful and less contractive with the diversity of the entertainments tools offered for all types of people. We can also exchange information between us from all the world with emails, forums, websites, messages and so on. Taking the example of the number of the social media applications who had increased in the last 10 years. We can name WhatsApp, Messenger, Twitter, Telegram, Instagram and so on. All these diverse and concrete tools are making a revolution in the world of communication, information and entertainment.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; In the other side, the excessive use of this devices can impose some disadvantages to us like addiction. And this might be dangerous for our mental as well as physical health that can end up with us with some chronic deseases. Also, due to this addiction, we can loose our relationships with others at work, university and also at home with&nbsp; our family when we become attached to our smartphones like a baby is attached to his mother, he can not let her. To emphasize these ideas, we should mention that statistics had shown that the over attach to smartphones led to distraction with people and their professional environemnet and affected their work quality and rendment. It had shown also that the massive expose to screens will affect our eyes by time and may cause blind deseases in some cases.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; We can not deny that these concerns are valid in a way, but in the other way smartphones had took us and our lives to another levels of evolution and sophistication.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; In a nutshell, smartphones are like a weapon with two sides; they offers benefits as well as inconvenients. But, it depends on how we will explore them. If we use them in a way that helps us facilitating and optimizing our lives, it will show us their best sides, else, its negative effects will be shown. So, what can we do to control our use of smart devices in genral ?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
88	121	\N	2024-12-23 12:09:55.26	69.50	[{"id": 1, "kind": "121", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\146\\\\SESSION_121_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "29-04-2025 19:28:36", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Francais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>De nos jours , les &eacute;preuves de la vie sont de plus en plus nombreux . Des fois , les gens se trouvent obliger de g&eacute;rer plusieurs responsabilit&eacute;s , faire face a beaucoup de probl&eacute;me au meme temps . Afin d'affronter ses d&eacute;fis , certain pensent que l'activit&eacute; mentale et &eacute;motionnelle sont necessaires pour faire face &agrave; ses d&eacute;fis , d'autres voient qu'il faut se focaliser sur l'activit&eacute; physique pour pouvoir supporter ses d&eacute;fis a long terme .</p>\n<p>Dans un monde , ou chaque jours , il devient plus rapide et plus dure , est ce que pour reussir a surmonter les &eacute;preuves de la vies , la cl&eacute; de la r&eacute;silience est l'activit&eacute; physique ou bien l'activit&eacute; mentale et &eacute;motionnelle ?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Certains pensent que , avoir un bon mentale est&nbsp; un atout majeur pour l'Homme aujourd'hui , savoir g&eacute;rer ses &eacute;motions dans differents contexte , personels ou proffessionnelles , des fois les gens se trouvent avec des probl&eacute;mes familliaux ,&nbsp; des fois des simples probl&eacute;mes&nbsp; du quotidien comme une simple dispute avec la famille , ou bien des cas plus grave et douleureux &eacute;motionnellement&nbsp; . Dans ce cas l&agrave;&nbsp; il faut mettre ses &eacute;motions &agrave; cot&eacute; et pouvoir accomplir son travail , surout dans des postes sensibles ou il faut toujours faire preuve de comp&eacute;tences et veiller a accomplir ses taches . et dans l'autre sens , il faut savoir se deliberer des probl&eacute;mes et du stress du travail une fois avec les amis ou la famille . G&eacute;rer tout ca necessite une bonne sant&eacute; mentale et gestion &eacute;motionnelle .</p>\n<p>En contre partie , d'autres gens voient que c'est insuffisant de se concentrer , seulement , sur l'activit&eacute; mentale et &eacute;motionnelle , un bon mentale ou bout du temps finis par lacher s'il n'est pas accompagn&eacute; de l'activit&eacute; physique . le corps humain lui aussi a besoin d'etre entretenu pour pouvoir gerer le stress et les &eacute;preuves de la vie . Le nombre de maladies et de mort est de plus en plus de nos jours , dans toutes les tranches d'ages , c'est du a l'absence des activit&eacute;s physiques , ca sert a rien d'avoir un bon mentale , une parfaite maitrise des emotions ou d'etre un genie dans son domaine , si on est malade ou incapable d'exercer nos taches quotidiennes . Dans les pays devolop&eacute;s , il donne enormement d'importance pour les activit&eacute;s physiques , meme dans les milieux de travail , on trouve des terrains de sport , des tables ping pong , pour eux la sant&eacute; physique est une priorit&eacute; , en plus , faire des actitvit&eacute;s physiques aidre a prendre soins de sa sant&eacute; mentale .</p>\n<p>Avoir un bon mentale est tr&eacute;s important de nos jours , mais un bon mentale ca se devollope , c'est en forgeons qu'on devient forgeorons . mais d'abord il faut donner une importance &agrave; l'activit&eacute; physique&nbsp; et l'inclure dans notre quotidien , car la sant&eacute; physique c'est la base d'une sant&eacute; mentale et &eacute;motionnelle .&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Pour conclure , la cl&eacute; de la r&eacute;silience , c'est de savoir combiner une multitude d'activit&eacute; au meme temps , non seulement pour g&eacute;rer les &eacute;preuves et les obstacles mais aussi pour pouvoir tenir a long termes et etre consistent .Au final ,&nbsp; Pour avoir une vie &eacute;quilibrer il faut prendre soin de la sant&eacute; mentales mais aussi de la sant&eacute; physique.</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	1
