81	122	\N	2024-12-23 12:42:21.904	35.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\128\\\\SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "24-02-2025 11:23:09", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; The developing world is important in the live ,so artificial intelligence (AI) is one of the causes of developing in the word,it is becoming a powerful tool in education for example,it helps personalize learning ,automate tasks and improve efficiencly .However,it can uses also reases concerns about fairess and priavcy.AI hase a potencial to contribute to achievening some sustainble development goals(SDG) like better education,reducing inequalities.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; AI can improve the education by personalizing learning ,this help can improve the quality education.it which important in SDG10.</p>\n<p>AI can also automate the administrative tasks ,saving time and making university managment.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Despite benificts, AI has risks, AI can be sometimes baised to unfar for some people&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; It done right ,AI can achieve sustainble development goals &nbsp;like better education and reducing inequalities, so it is important to developing world</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	1
88	122	\N	2024-12-23 12:09:56.831	61.50	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\146\\\\SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "24-02-2025 11:35:31", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>Nowadays we cannot&nbsp; stay a single day , or maybe some hours , without our phones . In most cases our phones helps us in our daily tasks , throw them we can interact with friends and family and for some people their phone help them accomplish their jobs .</p>\n<p>In a world full of virtual connections , are smartphone addiction decreasing the physical connection between people and affecting negatively interpersonal relationships and professional environments ?&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Some people think that smartphone , ruin the interpersonal relationships , in our days , people spend a lot of times behind screens , families and friends use their phones even at lunch time . teenagers and childreen are isolated in their rooms connected to the virtual world , where they can meet a lot people who can affect them negatively . humans , day by day , cannot stay away from their phones .</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>On the other side , some people see that smartphones when used properly , can help us in every aspect of our life . they facilitate the communication and made everthing easy . technologies and smartphones helped us , in the covid period , where we were forced to stay at home , work and learning did not stop , in fact studies showed that it is become mush more efficient . smartphones help us in every aspect of our lives , including learning , communicating with family and friends and working from anywere at anytime we want .&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>In conclusion , the key is the balance , the mart ones are the ones that they know how to use properly smartphones and take advatange of this technologies and at the same time have a social life and dont become addicted to&nbsp; smartphones .</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
