84	121	\N	2024-12-23 12:46:12.571	49.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "121", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\6\\\\SESSION_121_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "29-04-2025 09:40:30", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Francais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;Tout le monde a un objectif principal dans cette vie, c'est le bonheur. Un parmi les facteurs cl&eacute;s de ce dernier consiste &agrave; la r&eacute;silience psychologique. La mani&eacute;re utilis&eacute;e pour supporter une &eacute;preuve ou un d&eacute;fi diff&eacute;re d'une personne &agrave; une autre.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; Il existe des personnes dont le support &eacute;motionnel est leur premi&eacute;re source d'energie dans des situations d&eacute;licates. Ce sont des personnes guid&eacute;es par l'amour et l'encadrement. On prend l'exemple d'une m&eacute;re qui se recharge et se reg&eacute;n&eacute;re seulement par le ragard de ses enfants. Par contre, d'autres personnes pr&eacute;f&eacute;rent les activit&eacute;s physiques ou mentales pour faire face &agrave; des moments difficiles comme une personne qui se prog&eacute;te enti&eacute;rement dans son boulot ou un sprotif qui eu recours &agrave; son sport pr&eacute;f&eacute;r&eacute; .&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;Finalement, il n'existe pas une formule magique qui permet de surmonter et g&eacute;rer parfaitement les &eacute;preuves de la vie. &ccedil;a peut etre un peu de tout, une combinaison &agrave; trouver par chacun d'entre nous.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	1
97	122	\N	2024-12-23 12:46:52.643	44.50	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\150\\\\SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "24-02-2025 20:01:05", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>Nowadays, the innovation in the technolgy fields is increase rapidely espacially the smartphones.</p>\n<p>The use of smartphones can be benefic but also nephast for human being.</p>\n<p>This essay will expose the advantages and the disadvantages of the smartphones.</p>\n<p>Firstly, the smartphones facilate the communication such as in the immergency cases. For exemple, the children can contact her parents rapidity if they are in the critical situation in the road.</p>\n<p>Additionally, the smartphones provide an accessibilty to worldwide. For instance, il can be simple to explore differents regions in the eargh via the location application.</p>\n<p>Moreover, the smartphones are a source of entertainment. As an exemple, it can be easyier to play with a social games with others.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>However, the smartphones are a source of distraction. It can disturb the concentration of the children due to their excessif use. Moreover, it can have an effect for the eyes.</p>\n<p>In addition, the smartphone addiction can have a negative effect in the relationships. It diminuate the real communication and the real contact with others.</p>\n<p>While this is valid, it can be evident to minimise the use of the smartphones.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>In conclusion, the smartphones is a double edge. It have an advantages but also a disadvantages.&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
100	122	\N	2024-12-23 12:45:46.94	51.50	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\151\\\\SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "24-02-2025 20:53:59", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; The evolution and the accecibility of the technological tools and devices like smartphones have made a changement of the interaction of the humain and the word. Two mainly ideas can be&nbsp; presented, the first one is the positive impact of this changement and the second one is the negative one.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Starting with the first idea, using the smartphone has significaly improved the quality of communication between people, for example family members or friends can make a daily video call. That can be good for those who are in deferent countries.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Also, acces to the information become simple, the news are broadcasted more rapidly.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; However, The excessive use of smartphones can be a problem. Specialy for teenagers, the abuse of the use of this device can become an addiction. It has separated them to their parents and has decreased their communication skills.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;In addition, virtual communication via the smartphones in the context of the learning can not replace the direct communication, for example for the virtual schools, sentiments are hard to be transmettes by virtual classes.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; So, Smartphone should be used with moderation to have the positive and be away to negative points.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>As conclusion, the smartphones can be considered as a revolution in the world of communication, acces to the information and entainment but they increase also the propabilty to addication or other problems.</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
