80	31	2025-06-04 19:25:28.431	2025-07-10 16:06:07.027	60.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "31", "path": "2\\\\135\\\\SESSION_31_1.pdf", "size": "1604.5 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "10-07-2025 16:06:07", "dateUpload": "24-03-2025 14:56:36", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "ichraf AYARI.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	\N	SOUMETTRE	{"noteC316": 5, "noteC3111": 0, "noteC3112": 6, "noteC3113": 0, "noteC3121": 5, "noteC3122": 8, "noteC3123": 19, "noteC3124": 16, "noteC3131": 8, "noteC3132": 2, "noteC3141": 2, "noteC3142": 0, "noteC3143": 0, "noteC3144": 0, "noteC3145": 4, "noteC3146": 2, "noteC3147": 0, "noteC3151": 5, "noteC3152": 0, "noteC3154": 0, "noteC3155": 0, "noteC31531": 0, "noteC31532": 0}	\N
102	122	\N	2024-12-23 12:46:38.272	58.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\136\\\\SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "24-02-2025 20:39:16", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; Nowadays, most of us own at least a smartphone or two, with a tablet and other smart devices at home.</p>\n<p>The spread of use of these devices especially smarphones, has its advantages like the ease of use of technical solutions, and its disadvantages mainly addictions and negative impact on personal and professional environements.</p>\n<p>The advantages of this smartphones revolution will be detailed in the first of this essay its disadvantages will be exposed in the second part</p>\n<p>Some people consider that smartphones really facilitates our lives. Do we need to wait many hours or days to learn about our family and hear from them waiting for a letter or a mail answer from them? It is surely not the case thanks to the use of smartphones. Nowadays, we can call each others from whereever&nbsp; and whenever we are. We do not need to sit on our computers and send an email for example.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>This is also the case of professionnal meetings. Many years ago, we needed to organize meeting in our offices and to spend time and effort to attend these meetings. Seen the possibility of remote meetings, we can simply organise a meeting with our smartphones and participate also from it.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Other people consder that smartphones has many negative impacts on our lives, especially due to addiction problems. Nowadays , statistics shows a peak in addiction to smart devices , especially for yougsters and gamers. It is not the only negative impact, smartphones has degraded the professional environemet by deconcentraining employees who scrolls on their smartphones during business hours or meetings.</p>\n<p>In conclusion, smartphones spread has its advantages ad disadvantages.</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
