104	122	\N	2024-12-23 12:45:52.104	49.50	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\141\\\\SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "24-02-2025 20:40:57", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; The smarthphones have revolutionized the communication way in our daily life. However, the emergence of this device has advantages and drawbacks. In the following, we will discuss the use of this device in our life.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;The smarthphone has been emerged as a communication device to ensure vocal communications and internet connection. But, the use of this device requires an analysis.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; In one hand, this device ensures a mobile connection around the world. Il allows the use of advanced communications applications such as visioconference. Il takes in charge also other entertainement applications such as gaming , shopping on line .....</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;In other hand, the use of this device has a negative impact. Indeed, it becomes addiction for some people. In addition, it affects the interpersonnal relationships. For example, the people have no rather interest to take advantage of family meetings.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; By the end, the use of this technology should be with conscience. It is important to sensibilize people about the importance of this issue.</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
