85	122	\N	2024-12-23 12:25:08.767	12.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\15\\\\SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "24-02-2025 11:39:53", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>Today, The technology are some adventages. In this context, i cited one of technology So the Smartphones have revolutionized the way we interact with the world around us, embodying a convergence of communication, information, and entertainment tools. However, their pervasive presence in our daily lives raises concerns about smartphone addiction and its ramifications for interpersonal relationships and professional environment.</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
