95	2112	\N	2025-02-17 15:34:06.06	83.50	[{"id": 1, "kind": "2112", "path": "2\\\\162\\\\SESSION_2112_1.mp4", "size": "323245.58 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "17-02-2025 15:34:06", "dateUpload": "17-02-2025 15:16:18", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Capsule_Anglais_Ons MARZOUGUI.mp4", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	\N	SOUMETTRE	\N	\N
93	122	\N	2024-12-23 12:45:52.525	63.50	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\149\\\\SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "24-02-2025 12:18:07", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;In recent years, the use of smartphones by the poeple in the world is significantly increased by 96%. These revolutionized devices, change and facilitate our daily life activities. Each person everywhere and anytime can connect to social media applications, communicate which each others, play games and exchange information. So, how the pervasive presence of smartphones in our daily lives raises concerns and what are its ramifications in our &nbsp;interpersonal relationships and professional environments? In this essay, we present the impacts of the frequent use of the smartphones in our socities. Then, we explicate why smartphone is an essentiel tool that each person need to use it in different purposes.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Some poeple, consider that smartphones can disrupt the attention of children and influence their results in schools due to the use of the various entertainment tools such as games, Youtube&nbsp; and tiktok. In fact, they spent a long duration in playing or using social media applications instead to revise their courses.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;In addition, the overreliance to smartphones can raise various concerns such as problems in person's healthcare. In another hand, they impact the productivity and creativity of persons which become passive humans that consume the different services providing by applications installed in smartphones whithout any effort.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; This is true, that smartphone is a major revolution that facilitate the communication with distant persons and in emergency situations. However, it affect the face-to-face interaction even with the members of the same family living in the same home. Also, the use of smartphoen everywhere and anytime esepecially in professional events results lack of attention and respect of each to other.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Smartphone is an essentiel tool in our life facilitating all our activities and providing services in different sectors. The addiction of the use of smartphones by people improve the distant relationships but reduce the interpersonal relationships and professional activities. Therefore, it is necessary to apply some guidelines and restrictions of the use of these devices in some situations.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="padding-left: 40px;">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="padding-left: 80px;">&nbsp;</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	2
