92	121	\N	2024-12-23 12:46:23.392	38.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "121", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\152\\\\SESSION_121_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "29-04-2025 19:46:52", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Francais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>La r&eacute;silience psychologique de l'individus est la capacit&eacute; de supporter les &eacute;preuves de la vie pour une meilleure gestion des missions et obligations de l'individu. Ce ph&eacute;nom&egrave;ne traite deux axes contradictoires: l'activit&eacute; physique et l'activit&eacute; mentale. Il y'a des gens qui voient que pour garantir la r&eacute;silience physique , il faut avoir un bon &eacute;tat de sant&eacute; physique, d'autres assument que la cl&eacute; pour cette r&eacute;silinece c'est d'avoir un bon &eacute;motionnel et un etat mental &eacute;quilibr&eacute;. Jusqu'a quel niveau ce point de vue est correcte?</p>\n<p>D'abord, l'etre humain est un corps qui doit avoir un bon &eacute;tat de sant&eacute;. Le fait de pratiquer le sport ou partager des connaissances avec des activit&eacute;s physiques permettent de rafraichir les id&eacute;es et bien b&eacute;n&eacute;ficier de ce qui sont historis&eacute;es d'une mani&egrave;re efficace. Prenons l'exemple de mod&eacute;lisation des pi&egrave;ces traditionnelles par les femmes aujourd'hui qui sont faites &agrave; main est un secteur dentance et en plus la femme elle meme via cette pratique partage un effort de beaut&eacute; f&eacute;minine et cibl&eacute;e pour une r&eacute;gion peut etre ni&eacute;e. Du coup, ce r&eacute;sultat est un succ&eacute;es et fi&eacute;rt&eacute; pour continuer &agrave; s'&eacute;panouir et s'investir en avant.</p>\n<p>Par contre, d'autres voient&nbsp;</p>\n<p>De ma part,</p>\n<p>En conclusion, la cl&eacute; de la r&eacute;silience psychologique r&eacute;side dans le fait d'avoir tout en ordre. La cr&eacute;ation physique et le repos mental avec un bon relationnel dans la vie sociale sont les facteurs pour s'&eacute;panuir, on ne peut pas nier l'importance d'une par rapport &agrave; l'autre.</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	1
100	213	\N	2025-02-16 19:42:39.175	73.00	[{"id": 1, "kind": "213", "path": "2\\\\151\\\\SESSION_213_1.pdf", "size": "166.96 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "16-02-2025 19:42:39", "dateUpload": "16-02-2025 11:25:36", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Liste des supports pédagogiques.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	\N	SOUMETTRE	\N	\N
73	122	\N	2024-12-23 12:48:48.849	127.50	[{"id": 1, "kind": "122", "path": "/mnt/core-data/appfiles/pgpg/uploadedFiles/2\\\\24\\\\SESSION_122_1.pdf", "size": null, "shown": true, "status": null, "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": null, "dateUpload": "18-02-2025 13:40:15", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Dissertation Anglais.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;According to Maslow's pyramid of needs,Self-actualization represents one of the most important needs for Human beings.This explains why humans thrive for success in different fields of life. Resilience therefore is one of the pillars to success. To be resilient is to overcome most challenges that everyone can face in life. Some people consider the key to resilience is physical activity,others assume that it is ultimately psychological. I reckon that the blueprint for resilience is the ability of an individual to psychologically support the trials of life through mental, emotional and social activity.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;People can be resilient mentally. In fact, they may rely on logic and critical thinking while dealing with life. For example, they can adopt problem solving skills in finding any solution to any challenge that may occur in life. Thinking about the most efficient solution can lead to be mentally resilient to negative thoughts, to aspire for a better future.This is why so many neurolinguists believe that if individuals our thoughts control us.This is why thinking positively can lead to achieve mental resilience.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Additionally, Individuals may be emotionally resilient once they know how to manage their feelings and others.Therefore, being skillful in emotional intelligence is one of the keys towards resilience. For instance, if someone meets any challenge in life the personal or professional life he/she can protect himself from depression and many other psychological diseases. Furthermore ,regulating one's emotions such as anger,sadness or even happiness can be very insightful to achieve well-being.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Resilience also can be socially embodied. As anyone should know how to deal with different personalities of people.this can be classified under the imbrella of social intellegent.Indeed, if you know how to deal with people and establish a healthy relationships with them can help you to be resilient to the social inconveniences may happen.For instance, the fact of being socially anxious let people not being able to live with people.This may lead to isolation and lack of communication.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Some critics argue that the road towards resilience should be physical.As people who work hard being tired to thrive life can&nbsp; achieve their goals and overcome hardships, they can definetely be successful in life. Undoubtedly, working hard and exercising physical effort can lead to resilience.However, it can affect psychological harms, as people they may suffer from many pschological illnesses.Body and soul affaect each other.if you are not psychologically balanced so many physical diseses can happn like blood pressure and heart attacks and that can lead to death.</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;In conclusion, Resilience is one of most striking skills that everyone should acquire in life to maintain a balanced mental health free from mental illnesses.maintaing growth mindset is the blueprint to be resilient in life.</p>	SOUMETTRE	\N	1
113	2112	\N	2025-02-16 11:38:51.281	78.75	[{"id": 1, "kind": "2112", "path": "2\\\\153\\\\SESSION_2112_1.mp4", "size": "265477.94 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "16-02-2025 11:38:51", "dateUpload": "16-02-2025 11:29:16", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Unity3d Triggers- Educational Capsule.mp4", "dateTelechargement": null}, {"id": 2, "kind": "2112", "path": "2\\\\153\\\\SESSION_2112_2.pdf", "size": "80.47 kb", "shown": true, "status": "SOUMETTRE", "sujetPV": null, "dateDepot": "16-02-2025 11:38:51", "dateUpload": "16-02-2025 11:37:41", "pvDocument": null, "responsable": null, "originalName": "Capsule_Description_En.pdf", "dateTelechargement": null}]	DONE	\N	SOUMETTRE	\N	\N
